# check=KeepGoing: a verification that fails stops nothing, so the second pass runs and the second function is heard of too. The first function fails behind both passes and has one line: its first.
# One more line counts the failures by pass and by what was found. The build fails all the same.
# FORM: Prepared
# RUN: pass SinkAllocations EliminateDeadCode
# DIAGNOSTIC: VerificationFailedAfterPass 2
# DIAGNOSTIC: BuildWentOnBehindFailedVerifications 1
# OPTIONS: check=VerifyEachPass check=KeepGoing sabotage=PassesDropCalls
# PROGRAM-OF: the-build-stops-at-a-verification-that-failed.ir
